  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>m</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>m</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>m</mi></mmultiscripts><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>m</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>m</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>m</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>m</mi></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>m</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>m</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>m</mi></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>By equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn></math></p>",
